        "label": "Colony vs Apiary",
        "focus": ["apiary", "colony", "worktrees", "runs-ipc", "task-ledger"],
        "note": "Committed colony config stays in git; secrets and JetStream KV stay machine-local; worktrees and runs are gitignored."
      },
      {
        "id": "trust-boundary",
        "label": "Trust boundary",
        "focus": ["queen-console", "apiary", "adapters", "agent-cli"],
        "note": "Queen Console has no auth. Paseka does not embed LLM logic; untrusted agent CLIs publish only through validated event emit."
      }
    ]
